---

This covers everything original to this repository: the tooling under
`tools/` and `tests/`, the glyph art under `glyphs/`, the built fonts in
`fonts/`, the boot splash `assets/logo_288x72.png`, and the previews.

Use it, ship it, remix a glyph, put it in a font pack. Credit is welcome
but not required.


Third-party material
--------------------

Not covered by the above, and not this project's to license:

    assets/references/stock/default_v1.mcm
    assets/references/stock/default_v2.mcm
    assets/references/png/*

These are the stock Betaflight analog OSD fonts, taken unmodified from
betaflight/betaflight-configurator (`resources/osd/1/default.mcm` and
`resources/osd/2/default.mcm`, commit 505bd6d); the PNGs are a mechanical
decode of the second. They are Copyright the Betaflight project and its
contributors, licensed **GPL-3.0**, and are included here only as a shape
reference and as a test fixture for round-trip verification.

    Betaflight Configurator: https://github.com/betaflight/betaflight-configurator
    GPL-3.0: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

No stock glyph art is used as a build base. The only bytes that reach a
built font from stock are the two protected indexes, `0x00` and `0xFF`,
both of which are blank.

`tools/crosscheck_configurator.mjs` executes Configurator source from a
checkout you supply at runtime. It neither copies nor redistributes any of
that source.
